# NOVR Events monorepo. Allow-list at the top level: only the two applications and the root files
# below are published. Everything else in this folder (backups, archives, internal progress notes,
# local agent state) stays local. Each application has its own .gitignore for its contents.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/novrevents-frontend/
!/novrevents-backend/

# ── Safety net, applied inside both applications ────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.next/
dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.log
backups/
archive/

.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
